1. DEFINITIONS

1.1 "Licensor" means Av. Vedat Murathan Kobya.

1.2 "Work" means the contents of this repository and of the website built from it, in whole or in
    part, except the Excluded Material defined in Section 6. It includes source code, markup,
    styles, animation and interaction logic, scripts, configuration, documentation, visual design,
    layout and graphics.

1.3 "Part" means any portion of the Work, whatever its size. This includes a single function, code
    snippet, style rule, animation sequence, design element or layout, whether it is copied
    verbatim, translated, modified or reproduced in substance.

1.4 "Use" means to copy, run, study, modify, adapt, translate, combine with other works, publish,
    distribute, communicate to the public, sublicense, sell or otherwise exploit the Work or any
    Part. It also means to create and distribute works based on them ("Derivative Works").

1.5 "Make Available" means to publish, distribute, deploy, host or otherwise provide the Work, a
    Part or a Derivative Work to anyone other than You, including as a website, application,
    service, template, package or publication.

1.6 "Substantial Copy" means any website, web page, template, theme, starter kit, application or
    other product that does either of the following:
    (a) reproduces the Work as a whole or in large part; or
    (b) reproduces the overall look and feel of the Work closely enough to be recognisably derived
        from it or confusingly similar to it.
    "Look and feel" means the combination of the Work's layout, section structure and order,
    typography, colour palette, graphic motifs and signature animations, such as the preloader,
    the masked headline reveals, the horizontally pinned process section, the practice-area
    accordion with counter, the seal emblem and the filling footer wordmark. A product is a
    Substantial Copy even if its names, texts, colours or images have been changed.

1.7 "You" means any natural or legal person exercising rights under this license.

